y drops below 60% at any timepoint", "Abort dose escalation if IC50 shifts indicate non-specific membrane disruption", "Cease cohort expansion if donor-matched variability exceeds predefined CV thresholds (>15%)", "Stop if no measurable GC structure forms by day 7 regardless of treatment"], "manual_result_schema": {"donor_id": "string", "hydrogel_batch_id": "string", "treatment_condition": "string", "concentration_nM": "number", "days_in_culture": "integer", "viability_percent": "number", "plasma_cell_frequency_percent": "number", "gc_architecture_score": "number", "bliss_synergy_index": "number", "chou_talalay_ci": "number", "prdm1_fold_change": "number"}, "safety_and_ethics": ["IRB-approved informed consent for human peripheral blood collection", "Adherence to BSL-2 laboratory practices for human cell culture", "Proper handling and disposal of cytotoxic small-molecule inhibitors per institutional EHS guidelines", "De-identification of all donor samples and compliance with HIPAA/GDPR data protection standards"], "cannot_establish_without_execution": "Computational environments and dry-lab simulations cannot replicate the complex biophysical constraints of hydrogel matrices, dynamic cytokine gradients, or real-time epigenetic-transcriptional crosstalk required to validate synergistic plasma cell differentiation; empirical wet-lab execution with multi-parameter single-cell readouts is strictly necessary."}, "tool_receipts": []}}
